Control and Prevention; 2024. [13-October-2024]. Applying to Be a Fellow [Internet] https://www.cdc.gov/lls/php/participants/index.html accessed. [ Google Scholar ] 13. McColloch C, Davis M, Araujo A, Theodore S, Barkley J, et al. Lessons learned for public health workforce development: an evaluation of the centers for disease control and prevention’s laboratory leadership service fellowship. Eval Program Plann. 2022;95:102147. doi: 10.1016/j.evalprogplan.2022.102147. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 14. Laboratory Leadership Service (LLS) Centers for Disease Control and Prevention; 2024. [13-October-2024]. What fellows do [Internet] https://www.cdc.gov/lls/php/our-work/index.html# ‌cdc_pir_special_topics_timeline-about accessed. [ Google Scholar ] 15. Martin, M (matthew.martin@slh.wisc.edu). Re: LLS Experience. [Personal email, 28 Dec 2023] to McCutchen E (emily.mccutchen@unmc.edu) 16. Association of Public Health Laboratories (APHL) About APHL [Internet] [17-December-2023]. https://www.aphl.org/AboutAPHL/Pages/default.aspx n.d. accessed. 17. Association of Public Health Laboratories (APHL) Leading the labs that protect the nation’s health: Association of Public Health Laboratories [Internet] 2015 https://www.aphl.org/aboutAPHL/publications/Documents/APHL_Brochure2015_web.pdf 18. Street, K (kathleen.street@APHL.org). APHL Leadership Program Metrics. [Personal email, 10 Jun 2025] to Street, K (Kathleen.street@APHL.org) 19. Association of Public Health Laboratories (APHL) Resources developed by emerging leaders [Internet] [17-December-2023]. https://www.aphl.org/Career-Pathways/Leadership/Pages/leadershipresources.aspx n.d. accessed. 20. Soehnlen M, Levinson K. Laboratory leadership and management: laboratory systems perspective. Lecture/keynote presented at: Association of Public Health Laboratories 2023 annual conference; Sacramento, United States: SAFE Credit Union Convention Center; May 23, 2023. [ Google Scholar ] 21. Iwen, P (piwen@unmc.edu). Leadership Paper Quote. [Personal email, 10 Jan 2024] to McCutchen E (emily.mccutchen@unmc.edu) 22. Bean, C (christine.bean@APHL.org). Quote re: APHL leadership development programs for possible external publication submission. [Personal email, 12 Dec 2023] to Street, K (kathleen.street@APHL.org) 23. Code of Federal Regulations . Washington (DC): U.S. Government Publishing; 2022. Title 42- Public Health, Vol 5 (Part 493), 2022 ed. https://www.govinfo.gov/app/details/CFR-2022-title42-vol5/CFR-2022-title42-vol5-part493 [ Google Scholar ] 24. Association of Public Health Laboratories (APHL) APHL ColLABorate [Internet] [15-January-2024]. https://collaborate.aphl.org/home n.d. accessed. 25. Leider JP, Castrucci BC, Robins M, Hare Bork R, Fraser MR, et al. The exodus of state and local public health employees: separations started before and continued throughout COVID-19. Health Affairs. 2023;42:338–348. doi: 10.1377/hlthaff.2022.01251. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 26. World Health Organization . World Health Organization [WHO]; 2019. Laboratory leadership competency framework [Internet] https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/9789241515108 [ Google Scholar ] 27. Polansky L, Chester S, Warren M, Aden T, Kennedy P, et al. Can mentorship improve laboratory quality? A case study from influenza diagnostic laboratories in Southeast Europe. BMC Health Serv Res. 2019;19:49. doi: 10.1186/s12913-018-3840-0. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 28. Yenyetou D, Sanou I, Madingar PD-M, Ouattara C, Zongo E, et al. Impact of mentoring on the implementation of the quality management system in clinical laboratories in Burkina Faso, West Africa. Account Res. 2024;31:515–527. doi: 10.1080/08989621.2022.2145957. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 29. Gopolang F, Zulu-Mwamba F, Nsama D, Kruuner A, Nsofwa D, et al. Improving laboratory quality and capacity through leadership and management training: lessons from Zambia 2016–2018. African Journal of Laboratory Medicine . 2021;10:1225. doi: 10.4102/ajlm.v10i1.1225. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 30. Nature . Nature; 2024. [13-October-2024]. Mentoring | Nature Awards for Mentoring [Internet] https://www.nature.com/nature/awards/mentorship accessed. [ Google Scholar ] 31. Clynes M, Corbett A, Overbaugh J. Why we need good mentoring. Nat Rev Cancer. 2019;19:489–493. doi: 10.1038/s41568-019-0173-1. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ]',13,'2025-10-20 07:04:19','2025-10-20 07:04:19');
